# The exact denial each document in storage-two-volume-sources.yaml must produce.
# scripts/test-policy-fixtures.sh compares this whole set: a message that
# disappears is a weakened rule, a message that appears is an unreviewed
# denial. File-level rejection alone hides both.
PersistentVolume storage-two-sources must declare exactly one volume source, found 2
PersistentVolume storage-two-sources uses volume source nfs, which is not an enumerated local means
